{"id":"n72046-1-2","stage":4,"title":"이를테면 · 换言之","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72046-1-2-1","ko":"하숙집 아주머니가 많은 도움을 주셨다면서?","zh":"听说寄宿房东阿姨帮了你很多？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하숙집","meaning":"寄宿处","explanation":"하숙집：寄宿处","readings":[{"term":"하숙집","audio":"/audio/6b16112885ac042d03ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72407","senseId":"1","lemma":"하숙집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주머니가","meaning":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","explanation":"아주머니：大嫂，大妈，阿姨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89820","senseId":"2","lemma":"아주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도움을","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셨다면서?","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","explanation":"주다：使感到，使受到，带来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"3","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6b16112885ac042d","term":"하숙집","zh":"寄宿处","audio":"/audio/6b16112885ac042d03ec.mp3","entryId":"72407","definition":"交一定的房租和伙食费而吃住的人家。","pronunciation":["하ː숙찝"]},{"id":"32bc34ce0694e2e2","term":"아주머니","zh":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3","entryId":"89820","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼已婚女子。","pronunciation":["아주머니"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","term":"도움","zh":"帮助，帮忙，援助","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3","entryId":"64542","definition":"帮扶他人的事宜。","pronunciation":["도움"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"使感到，使受到，带来","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"让别人经历某事或产生某种情绪。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f870d3518886eb1d56a1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72046-1-2-2","ko":"그분은 이를테면 내게 어머니와 같은 존재셔.","zh":"她对我来说，就像母亲一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그분은","meaning":"那位","explanation":"그분：那位；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그분","audio":"/audio/9d7be380673c1fb2eb99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60635","senseId":"1","lemma":"그분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이를테면","meaning":"换言之","explanation":"이를테면：换言之","readings":[{"term":"이를테면","audio":"/audio/5f1e266cc7e9bc1297f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72046","senseId":"1","lemma":"이를테면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니와","meaning":"妈妈，母亲","explanation":"어머니：妈妈，母亲；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"5","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"존재셔.","meaning":"存在","explanation":"존재：存在；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"존재","audio":"/audio/d73ba417c73c2bb9b803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24612","senseId":"1","lemma":"존재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9d7be380673c1fb2","term":"그분","zh":"那位","audio":"/audio/9d7be380673c1fb2eb99.mp3","entryId":"60635","definition":"(高尊)那个人。","pronunciation":["그분"]},{"id":"5f1e266cc7e9bc12","term":"이를테면","zh":"换言之","audio":"/audio/5f1e266cc7e9bc1297f7.mp3","entryId":"72046","definition":"换句话说。","pronunciation":["이를테면"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"妈妈，母亲","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"(喻义)像对待子女一样关爱、爱护和牵挂自己的人或那样的存在。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"d73ba417c73c2bb9","term":"존재","zh":"存在","audio":"/audio/d73ba417c73c2bb9b803.mp3","entryId":"24612","definition":"实际上有；或指那样的对象。","pronunciation":["존재"]}],"audio":"/audio/be1a3bdd4d8ad8eaac25.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72046","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说寄宿房东阿姨帮了你很多？","她对我来说，就像母亲一样。","你们现在在聊什么呀？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说寄宿房东阿姨帮了你很多？","她对我来说，就像母亲一样。","你们现在在聊什么呀？"],"answer":1}]}
